Thank you for your excellent guide! With your help, my upgrades went smooth
and pain free.

I have two suggestions:

Give explicit examples of running leapp with --no-rhsm

Like:

    # leapp preupgrade --no-rhsm

    # leapp upgrade --no-rhsm


Now that CentOS Stream 8 is End Of Life, you may want to add instructions for
setting repos appstream, baseos, extras and extras-common to vault.centos.org
to avoid

    Error: Failed to download metadata for repo 'appstream':
    Cannot prepare internal mirrorlist: No URLs in mirrorlist

Thanks Again!

 -Bruce
